{"unit_id": "tag:02V3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。假设<MATH_0002>为局部有限型（locally of finite type）。集合（set）\n<MATHSEG_0001>是完全交（complete intersection），基取为<MATHSEG_0002>\n的构造与任意基变换（base change）交换（commutes）：对于任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，考虑基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>，它由<MATH_0005>得到，并考虑投影（projection）<MATH_0006>。则相应的集合（set）<MATH_0007>在态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>的情形下等于<MATH_0009>。特别地，若假设<MATH_0010>平坦（flat）且为局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），则同样的结论也适用于如下开（open）集合（set），其中的点恰为<MATH_0011>是合成（syntomic）的点。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "说明所给态射的对象类别。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "说明起始给定的映射属于概形范畴。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第一部分对所给态射的假设。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指由完全交条件确定的集合。"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交", "context": "指受保护数学表达式中界定集合的性质。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指集合的构造与之交换的任意基变换。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "描述集合的构造与任意基变换的关系。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指用于作基变换的任意态射。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "指由给定对象所得的基变换。"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "指作基变换后所考虑的投影。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指基变换之后相应的集合。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指基变换后用于确定相应集合的态射。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "后一断言对所给态射的假设之一。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "后一断言对所给态射的另一项假设。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "说明后一断言所指集合是开的。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指由合成条件界定的点的集合。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成", "context": "指后一断言中确定哪些点属于该集合的性质。"}], "notes": []}
